 "giver_dossier": "# Quests of Baron von Darkcheat (Snowhill)\n\n## Summary\n\nBaron von Darkcheat (npc 9000000020, Snowhill) gives two quests per `quests_given_text`. Both already exist in `prototype/osfr-tools/data/content/quests/card_duelist.json` as skeleton entries, so there is no new quest to build. Below is the evidence for the existing entries so a builder can fill their gaps. Nothing here adds a new quest.\n\n## 1. Card Duelist: Baron von Darkcheat (id 3040052), already built as skeleton\n\n- **Status in repo:** `quests/card_duelist.json:2518-2567`. `giver_npc_id` 9000000020, `title_string_id` 436554, `intro_text_string_id` 436553, `description_string_id` 436555, `end_text_string_id` 436556, `objectives` [], `rewards` [], `prerequisite_quest_ids` [], `enabled` false. The NPC file lists it as `quest_ids_given` 3040052 (`npcs/snowhill.json:1721-1769`).\n- **Title:** locale 436554 \"Card Duelist: Baron von Darkcheat\". The guide's cell hash 2220173659 does not resolve as a table id, so the 436554 correction in the NPC file is the only resolution.\n- **Offer / description (locale 436555):** \"Baron von Darkcheat in Snowhill wants you to play a few games of cards.\"\n- **Intro (locale 436553):** \"I have the Gloamstone and now you will do my bidding! I can make anybody do whatever I want!<BR><BR>Wait... that didn't work. Maybe I should defeat you in a game of cards... let's play a few games!\" Note: this reads as a mid-fight speech, not an offer, so the `intro_text_string_id` assignment is doubtful.\n- **Completion (locale 436556):** \"*The Gloamstone hums with dark energy.<BR><BR>You get the feeling that it want's you to become it's new owner...*\"\n- **Steps (evidence is partial):**\n  1. Talk to the Baron in Snowhill (offer 436555). Location is from the guide, row 51.\n  2. Play the Baron's card decks. Locale texts exist at 8387 \"Beat Darkcheat's First Deck\", 8388 \"Beat Darkcheat's Second Deck\", 8389 \"Beat Darkcheat's Third Deck\", 8390 \"Beat Darkcheat's Fourth Deck\". The guide cites hashes 3166174091, 2785568298, 3744862732, 3928369198 for these, which do not resolve. Attribution of 8387-8390 to this quest is inferred from text match, not from a confirmed id.\n  3. Win the match with the Baron's \"Round\" lines. Locale 439484 is the Baron's post-defeat speech (\"I can restore the power of The First Deck! ... become the King of Sacred Grove!\"). The guide cites it as 902343902, which does not resolve. Its position in the sequence is unknown.\n  4. Completion text 436556 (above).\n- **Prerequisites:",
